 # PlanKick
 
+## Dry run
+
+Set `dry_run: true` in `PlanKick.yaml` to run the normal freshness, distance, and alignment checks, log the selected leg and measurements, and return before this planner emits a `Kick` task.
+
+This only suppresses `Kick` tasks emitted by `PlanKick`. Other kick-producing tasks are unaffected, so disable them for an isolated dry-run test.
+
+For a test role, enable `Tester` with only `tasks.kick_to_priority` nonzero. Keep walking and other kick-producing tasks disabled. The role still needs fresh `Ball` and `Sensors` messages for `PlanKick` to evaluate an intent.
+
